WEBVTT

00:00:03.881 --> 00:00:05.251
Humans!

00:00:05.251 --> 00:00:08.001
Take heed, lest you be annihilated!

00:00:08.001 --> 00:00:10.761
I bear a message from the depths!

00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:21.641
You will surrender the surface to us,
the Clan of the Seafolk!

00:00:25.731 --> 00:00:30.821
Thereafter, you shall become
our nourishment, human scum—

00:00:33.321 --> 00:00:37.991
Nice head! Are you related to an octopus?

00:00:43.411 --> 00:00:46.541
I heard it was that same guy again.

00:00:46.541 --> 00:00:47.751
What was his name?

00:00:48.251 --> 00:00:51.301
I forget, but he's super strong.

00:00:56.711 --> 00:00:59.801
65. Name: Rare marine life form passing by ID:lispmp2487

00:00:56.711 --> 00:00:59.921
he takes out every oppenent with a single punch.

00:00:56.711 --> 00:01:02.171
66. Name: Rare marine life form passing by ID:mfygnasg9

00:00:56.711 --> 00:01:02.221
didn't he turn out to be a fraud?

00:00:56.711 --> 00:01:02.721
67. Name: Rare marine life form passing by ID:mdlksu018

00:00:56.711 --> 00:01:02.721
ya he just keeps stealing credit from others

00:00:59.711 --> 00:01:02.721
68. Name: Rare marine life form passing by ID:bfgsdyu66

00:00:59.711 --> 00:01:02.721
he's just some lousy C-class

00:01:02.091 --> 00:01:02.721
69. Name: Rare marine life form passing by ID:jcsdfb120

00:01:02.091 --> 00:01:02.721
he's also baldy

00:01:03.311 --> 00:01:04.191
C-class?

00:01:06.061 --> 00:01:07.191
Never seen him before.

00:01:08.941 --> 00:01:10.281
I've got to keep up.

00:01:10.271 --> 00:01:13.031
Class C Rank 5 : Saitama

00:01:28.461 --> 00:01:32.961
THE DEEP SEA KING

00:01:33.261 --> 00:01:36.471
Help! Somebody!

00:01:37.301 --> 00:01:41.471
We, the Clan of the Seafolk,
now rule the surface!

00:01:41.471 --> 00:01:43.561
Resistance is futile!

00:01:47.771 --> 00:01:49.731
You'll pay for that, human!

00:01:51.731 --> 00:01:54.651
Rising in popularity and currently ranked 11th in Class A…

00:01:54.651 --> 00:01:58.201
Everyone's favorite hero,
Stinger, is here to help!

00:01:58.201 --> 00:01:59.701
At your service, everyone!

00:02:00.071 --> 00:02:01.081
It's Stinger!

00:02:01.081 --> 00:02:02.081
We're saved!

00:02:02.081 --> 00:02:03.201
Go get 'em!

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:05.961
Well now…

00:02:06.541 --> 00:02:11.001
Anyone who wants a new blowhole drilled into them, step right up!

00:02:20.341 --> 00:02:24.091
ONE PUNCH

00:02:27.801 --> 00:02:29.551
THREE, TWO, ONE, KILL SHOT

00:02:29.551 --> 00:02:33.311
JOIN THE FIGHT, CERTAIN VICTORY, THE STRONGEST EVER

00:02:29.551 --> 00:02:33.311
SANJOU, HISSHOU, SHIJOU SAIKYOU

00:02:33.311 --> 00:02:35.311
WHAT WAS THAT? FRUSTRATION

00:02:33.311 --> 00:02:35.311
NAN DATTEN DA? FRUSTRATION

00:02:35.311 --> 00:02:36.811
THERE'S NO STOPPING ME

00:02:35.311 --> 00:02:36.811
ORE WA TOMARANAI

00:02:36.811 --> 00:02:40.941
ONE PUNCH, IT'S OVER, VICTORY AFTER VICTORY

00:02:36.811 --> 00:02:40.941
ONE PUNCH, KANRYOU, RENSENRENSHOU

00:02:40.941 --> 00:02:44.571
I WIN, I ALWAYS WIN, OVERWHELMINGLY

00:02:40.941 --> 00:02:44.571
ORE WA KATSU, TSUNE NI KATSU, ASSHOU

00:02:44.571 --> 00:02:48.411
POWER, GET POWER

00:02:48.411 --> 00:02:51.371
RIGHT TO THE VERY LIMIT

00:02:48.411 --> 00:02:51.371
GIRIGIRI GENKAI MADE

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:52.581
HERO

00:02:52.581 --> 00:02:55.751
PEOPLE SHOWER ME WITH PRAISE

00:02:52.581 --> 00:02:55.751
ORE O TATAERU KOE YA

00:02:55.751 --> 00:02:58.791
BUT I DON'T DO THIS FOR THE FAME

00:02:55.751 --> 00:02:58.791
KASSAI NANTE HOSHIKU WA NAI SA

00:02:58.791 --> 00:03:00.041
HERO

00:03:00.041 --> 00:03:04.801
SO I JUST FIGHT EVIL IN SECRET

00:03:00.041 --> 00:03:04.801
DAKARA HITOSHIREZU AKU TO TATAKAU

00:03:04.801 --> 00:03:06.261
(NOBODY KNOWS WHO HE IS)

00:03:06.261 --> 00:03:10.431
COUNTLESS ENEMIES FILL THE SKY

00:03:06.261 --> 00:03:10.431
SORA OOI OSHIYOSERU TEKI

00:03:10.431 --> 00:03:13.511
BUT I WON'T TURN MY BACK AND FLEE

00:03:10.431 --> 00:03:13.511
ORE WA SE WO MUKE WA SHINAI

00:03:13.511 --> 00:03:14.851
HERO

00:03:14.851 --> 00:03:19.851
I'VE MADE UP MY MIND AND I WON'T GIVE IN

00:03:14.851 --> 00:03:19.851
NARABA YURUGINAKI KAKUGO SHITA TAME

00:03:19.851 --> 00:03:27.071
A FIGHTING HERO

00:03:19.851 --> 00:03:27.071
TATAKAU HERO

00:03:27.071 --> 00:03:33.621
A SOLITARY HERO

00:03:27.071 --> 00:03:33.621
KODOKU NA HERO

00:03:33.621 --> 00:03:38.621
I WANNA BE THE STRONGEST HERO

00:03:33.621 --> 00:03:38.621
I WANNA BE A SAIKYOU HERO

00:03:44.551 --> 00:03:45.511
Master…

00:03:45.511 --> 00:03:48.181
You have moved up to rank 2 in Class C.

00:03:48.971 --> 00:03:51.481
You are on the verge of entering Class B!

00:03:52.061 --> 00:03:53.771
Class B, huh?

00:03:53.771 --> 00:03:56.771
That means I won't have any more
weekly hero quotas, right?

00:03:56.771 --> 00:03:57.521
Correct.

00:03:58.231 --> 00:03:59.941
Oh, excuse me…

00:03:59.941 --> 00:04:00.981
Hello?

00:04:00.981 --> 00:04:03.481
City J? It is a bit far.

00:04:03.481 --> 00:04:05.651
Are there no competent heroes nearby?

00:04:05.651 --> 00:04:07.281
Busy guy…

00:04:08.951 --> 00:04:10.411
Master!

00:04:10.411 --> 00:04:13.241
The monster you defeated on your way home the other day

00:04:13.241 --> 00:04:15.661
called itself one of the "Seafolk," right?

00:04:15.661 --> 00:04:16.751
I forget.

00:04:17.911 --> 00:04:22.301
Several monsters calling themselves the "Clan of the Seafolk"

00:04:22.301 --> 00:04:24.851
have appeared in City J and
are attacking anyone in sight.

00:04:23.101 --> 00:04:28.731
An A-class hero is fighting them all alone
and on the brink of defeat.

00:04:24.851 --> 00:04:27.351
An A-class hero is struggling against them

00:04:25.301 --> 00:04:30.551
Multiple monsters

00:04:25.301 --> 00:04:30.551
emerge at City J's seashore

00:04:25.301 --> 00:04:30.551
LIVE At City J

00:04:27.351 --> 00:04:33.311
but he's at his limit and his extreme fatigue and pain are apparent.

00:04:33.311 --> 00:04:36.821
A prompt response from the
Hero Association is desperately needed.

00:04:36.821 --> 00:04:37.991
Hang on!

00:04:37.991 --> 00:04:39.531
The threat level is Tiger.

00:04:38.691 --> 00:04:42.941
Multiple monsters

00:04:38.691 --> 00:04:42.941
emerge at City J's seashore

00:04:38.691 --> 00:04:42.941
LIVE At City J

00:04:39.531 --> 00:04:42.951
All citizens are asked to stay out of the area.

00:04:44.741 --> 00:04:48.201
You've got spunk, you slimy sons of bitches.

00:04:49.041 --> 00:04:51.331
My beloved Bamboo Shoot here

00:04:51.331 --> 00:04:54.961
is happy to be battling enemies with some grit for a change.

00:04:55.671 --> 00:04:57.711
But it's time to end this.

00:04:58.301 --> 00:05:00.261
You can quit your bluffing, human!

00:05:00.261 --> 00:05:03.761
Your foolish fan club has run off.

00:05:03.761 --> 00:05:06.101
But you won't have that luxury.

00:05:06.101 --> 00:05:09.481
You will suffer long and hard
for taking our brothers' lives.

00:05:09.481 --> 00:05:11.351
Four fish to go!

00:05:11.851 --> 00:05:15.731
It's a lot easier without an audience!

00:05:16.691 --> 00:05:18.231
Sing, Bamboo Shoot!

00:05:22.031 --> 00:05:25.991
Gigantic Drill Stinger Quadruple Thrust!

00:05:28.291 --> 00:05:29.911
I did it…

00:05:29.911 --> 00:05:31.281
I did it!

00:05:31.711 --> 00:05:35.751
These monsters were probably a God-level threat,

00:05:35.961 --> 00:05:37.081
and I beat them all by my—

00:05:38.091 --> 00:05:41.421
You know, when something's this annoying,

00:05:41.421 --> 00:05:42.931
it's a pleasure to watch it die.

00:05:48.351 --> 00:05:50.561
How much farther is City J?

00:05:50.561 --> 00:05:52.351
We are almost there.

00:05:52.351 --> 00:05:53.691
But I am getting no readings.

00:05:54.351 --> 00:05:55.441
I will scout ahead.

00:05:55.441 --> 00:05:57.981
Once I have confirmed their location,
I will let you know.

00:05:59.031 --> 00:06:00.321
H-Hey!

00:06:02.571 --> 00:06:05.951
This is an announcement from the Hero Association.

00:06:05.951 --> 00:06:09.371
The threat level is: Tiger.

00:06:09.371 --> 00:06:13.201
All citizens, please stay clear of the area.

00:06:13.201 --> 00:06:15.831
CITY A

00:06:13.201 --> 00:06:15.831
HERO ASSOCIATION HQ

00:06:14.871 --> 00:06:15.831
Was the warning issued?

00:06:16.131 --> 00:06:18.171
The request just went out.

00:06:18.171 --> 00:06:21.381
We'll need to update and re-issue it.

00:06:22.091 --> 00:06:22.921
What do you mean?

00:06:22.921 --> 00:06:24.381
Stinger is down.

00:06:28.101 --> 00:06:31.311
Mumen Rider here. I'm heading in.

00:06:31.311 --> 00:06:32.731
Give me the location.

00:06:32.731 --> 00:06:34.891
All lines are busy at this time—

00:06:34.891 --> 00:06:35.901
Where are they?

00:06:35.901 --> 00:06:37.981
Hey, best forget it!

00:06:38.981 --> 00:06:41.481
This one's above our pay grade.

00:06:41.481 --> 00:06:42.241
Huh?

00:06:42.241 --> 00:06:45.241
The word just came down.

00:06:45.241 --> 00:06:47.371
Emergency evacuation warning.

00:06:47.371 --> 00:06:51.161
The threat level has been
raised from Tiger to Demon.

00:06:51.161 --> 00:06:55.291
All residents of City J, please evacuate immediately.

00:06:51.871 --> 00:06:53.121
See what I mean?

00:06:55.291 --> 00:06:55.751
Hey!

00:06:55.751 --> 00:06:57.251
I repeat.

00:06:57.251 --> 00:07:01.251
All residents of City J, please evacuate immediately.

00:07:01.881 --> 00:07:03.381
Evacuate?

00:07:03.381 --> 00:07:04.721
How foolish.

00:07:05.421 --> 00:07:08.011
As if I'd allow even one of these apes to escape.

00:07:11.811 --> 00:07:14.181
So that's the one that got Stinger…

00:07:14.981 --> 00:07:16.851
But he's the last of 'em.

00:07:16.851 --> 00:07:18.191
Should I wait for backup?

00:07:18.191 --> 00:07:21.651
If it's one-on-one, maybe I can—

00:07:30.031 --> 00:07:31.531
That stung.

00:07:31.531 --> 00:07:32.951
Why would you do that?

00:07:33.331 --> 00:07:35.751
Dammit, how'd he get behind me?

00:07:35.751 --> 00:07:37.461
I was so surprised, my voice went all funky.

00:07:38.251 --> 00:07:40.841
Plus, my gunpowder-charged
lightning kick had no effect!

00:07:41.211 --> 00:07:42.881
I can't win.

00:07:42.881 --> 00:07:44.341
Who are you?

00:07:44.801 --> 00:07:46.171
I am…

00:07:46.171 --> 00:07:48.801
Lightning Max, the hero.

00:07:48.801 --> 00:07:49.721
Fight me.

00:07:49.721 --> 00:07:53.221
Fight you? With pleasure.

00:07:51.631 --> 00:07:53.221
I'll run for it as soon as—

00:07:57.891 --> 00:08:00.101
What happened?

00:08:00.521 --> 00:08:03.111
I can't feel my body…

00:08:09.821 --> 00:08:10.741
Dammit.

00:08:10.741 --> 00:08:13.241
You arrogant bastard…

00:08:14.081 --> 00:08:19.001
Lightning Flying Reverse Roundhouse Kick!

00:08:36.721 --> 00:08:38.681
S-class hero,

00:08:38.681 --> 00:08:40.231
Puri-Puri Prisoner.

00:08:41.191 --> 00:08:44.071
I escaped from prison just to see you!

00:08:44.071 --> 00:08:45.151
Well, well.

00:08:45.821 --> 00:08:48.951
A hero serving time in prison?

00:08:50.071 --> 00:08:53.701
I knew I'd be able to escape if I followed you.

00:08:54.031 --> 00:08:55.031
My thanks.

00:08:55.031 --> 00:08:59.211
Prisoner number 4188, Sonic, right?

00:09:00.081 --> 00:09:01.581
Surprised?

00:09:01.581 --> 00:09:03.831
I keep tabs on all the boys who catch my eye.

00:09:04.461 --> 00:09:09.721
I'm serving a life sentence because
I can't resist attacking beautiful men.

00:09:10.221 --> 00:09:10.841
Oh my.

00:09:12.011 --> 00:09:15.761
More soldiers have come for me?

00:09:19.351 --> 00:09:20.561
Goodness!

00:09:20.561 --> 00:09:23.191
I feel the power about to erupt out of him!

00:09:23.191 --> 00:09:24.731
Sonic, dear, you hang back.

00:09:26.021 --> 00:09:28.691
Class A rank 11, sweet Stinger.

00:09:28.691 --> 00:09:30.991
Class A rank 20, Lightning Max.

00:09:31.451 --> 00:09:34.241
I fancied them both.

00:09:34.661 --> 00:09:37.621
And yet you ruined them!

00:09:37.621 --> 00:09:40.831
Now that Genos has passed me,
I may be the lowest in rank,

00:09:40.831 --> 00:09:42.921
but I am still an S-class hero!

00:09:42.921 --> 00:09:44.831
I am unlike either of them.

00:09:45.331 --> 00:09:49.591
I'll begin at half power,
to gauge how much you can take.

00:09:58.101 --> 00:10:03.351
You made me rip the hand-knit sweater my boyfriend made!

00:10:03.351 --> 00:10:09.111
I will never, ever forgive you!

00:10:10.531 --> 00:10:13.361
What a prime, delectable slab of meat.

00:10:13.361 --> 00:10:15.361
My appetite's up!

00:10:23.291 --> 00:10:23.961
Huh?

00:10:24.501 --> 00:10:25.421
Oh my…

00:10:33.171 --> 00:10:34.631
I felt that…

00:10:35.261 --> 00:10:36.551
just a little.

00:10:37.091 --> 00:10:38.841
I felt that too.

00:10:38.841 --> 00:10:39.891
Just a little.

00:10:41.891 --> 00:10:46.151
Puri-Puri Prisoner is acting tough, but he's hurting.

00:10:46.151 --> 00:10:51.281
So this is what a fight between a Demon-level monster and an S-class hero looks like?

00:10:51.281 --> 00:10:52.531
It's almost comical.

00:10:53.781 --> 00:10:55.531
Neither of them could defeat me.

00:10:56.451 --> 00:10:57.621
Dammit…

00:10:57.621 --> 00:11:00.121
His punch was stronger than I expected.

00:11:00.121 --> 00:11:02.911
But I must not lose to him.

00:11:02.911 --> 00:11:07.171
I can't have any more of my boys
destroyed by this monster.

00:11:07.171 --> 00:11:08.541
I have no choice.

00:11:08.921 --> 00:11:10.671
I'll have to transform.

00:11:11.751 --> 00:11:13.211
Brace yourself!

00:11:13.841 --> 00:11:14.801
Transform!

00:11:17.591 --> 00:11:21.431
Puri-Puri Prisoner Angel Style!

00:11:22.851 --> 00:11:23.681
He's naked.

00:11:24.391 --> 00:11:26.391
And he's definitely no angel.

00:11:26.391 --> 00:11:27.941
Nor is he human.

00:11:27.941 --> 00:11:29.811
Nor do I want to watch.

00:11:29.811 --> 00:11:30.651
I'm out.

00:11:30.651 --> 00:11:34.441
No one has ever seen my Angel Style
and lived to tell the tale.

00:11:35.071 --> 00:11:36.991
All the more reason to leave.

00:11:37.401 --> 00:11:39.161
Quite unsightly.

00:11:39.741 --> 00:11:42.871
Are those your last words?

00:11:50.131 --> 00:11:51.831
Angel Rush!

00:12:01.301 --> 00:12:03.761
Elevated energy levels nearby.

00:12:04.101 --> 00:12:04.971
That must be it.

00:12:07.641 --> 00:12:11.021
Dammit! I have no way to reach Master!

00:12:11.651 --> 00:12:12.521
No matter.

00:12:20.871 --> 00:12:24.571
Done with your combo?

00:12:27.621 --> 00:12:30.081
I felt that… Just a little.

00:12:37.551 --> 00:12:38.341
Listen up.

00:12:38.721 --> 00:12:42.851
The purpose of a combination move
is to finish your opponent.

00:12:43.221 --> 00:12:46.811
Each separate attack must be
delivered with the intent to kill.

00:12:46.811 --> 00:12:49.021
Like this.

00:12:57.231 --> 00:12:59.031
Isn't this fun?

00:12:59.571 --> 00:13:01.911
Just who are you?

00:13:01.911 --> 00:13:03.951
I am the Deep Sea King.

00:13:03.951 --> 00:13:07.871
As lord of the Clan of the Seafolk, this world is mine to rule.

00:13:08.831 --> 00:13:11.121
Do you dare defy me as well?

00:13:12.251 --> 00:13:15.921
You think you have the strength to rule the surface all alone?

00:13:15.921 --> 00:13:16.881
That's pathetic.

00:13:16.881 --> 00:13:18.301
Oh?

00:13:18.301 --> 00:13:20.761
Then I suppose you must die.

00:13:20.761 --> 00:13:22.431
That's my line.

00:13:22.431 --> 00:13:28.061
I would have let you live
if you'd shown me due respect.

00:13:28.061 --> 00:13:31.271
I'm no hero, but I will eliminate you.

00:13:32.021 --> 00:13:34.651
The rain is falling.

00:13:38.401 --> 00:13:39.281
Too slow.

00:13:40.491 --> 00:13:41.611
Wind Blade Kick!

00:13:42.911 --> 00:13:46.781
Deep Sea King, I see right through your moves.

00:13:48.621 --> 00:13:50.541
Are you sure about that?

00:13:50.541 --> 00:13:53.921
Once it bites, my little moray here never lets go!

00:13:56.131 --> 00:13:57.671
Let me be clear.

00:13:57.671 --> 00:14:00.051
There's no way I'd ever lose to you.

00:14:05.761 --> 00:14:06.851
It's useless.

00:14:06.851 --> 00:14:08.561
You may have power…

00:14:12.231 --> 00:14:15.561
but you're too slow to fight me.

00:14:16.361 --> 00:14:17.401
I'm glad, Deep Sea King!

00:14:18.231 --> 00:14:22.901
Fighting someone like you
just confirms how strong I really am!

00:14:24.031 --> 00:14:26.911
You see, my moves are the fastest and the strongest!

00:14:31.161 --> 00:14:33.121
Now what? Have you lost your mind?

00:14:37.171 --> 00:14:37.921
He's faster!

00:14:40.751 --> 00:14:42.051
Stronger, too!

00:14:42.461 --> 00:14:44.381
What happened to him?

00:14:46.721 --> 00:14:48.101
He's huge!

00:14:48.101 --> 00:14:51.971
The air of the surface shriveled me up a bit,

00:14:51.971 --> 00:14:55.441
but thanks to this rain, I feel like myself again.

00:14:55.441 --> 00:14:58.941
Your attacks don't hurt me, not even a little!

00:15:13.861 --> 00:15:19.331
At this time, the whereabouts of the
Seafolk that attacked City J are unknown.

00:15:19.331 --> 00:15:22.081
Several heroes who tried to stop them

00:15:21.211 --> 00:15:24.341
Class A Rank 11

00:15:21.211 --> 00:15:24.341
Stinger is unconscious
and in critical condition

00:15:22.081 --> 00:15:26.791
have been found unconscious at the scene
and remain in a critical condition.

00:15:28.751 --> 00:15:30.801
Of all the times to hit a red light…

00:15:31.381 --> 00:15:33.921
Where'd he run off to?

00:15:35.801 --> 00:15:37.511
Wait, you're…

00:15:37.511 --> 00:15:39.351
Class C, rank 2.

00:15:39.351 --> 00:15:40.771
Are you a hero too?

00:15:41.811 --> 00:15:43.351
Have you seen Genos?

00:15:43.351 --> 00:15:44.941
Genos?

00:15:44.941 --> 00:15:46.521
Today, as our guest,

00:15:46.521 --> 00:15:49.521
we have the top-ranked A-class superhero

00:15:49.521 --> 00:15:54.111
who has also been number one in
popularity rankings for 28 weeks straight.

00:15:54.111 --> 00:15:57.911
He's also a successful model, actor, and singer.

00:15:57.911 --> 00:16:01.831
Let's welcome the handsomely masked Amai Mask!

00:16:02.741 --> 00:16:05.001
Amai Mask

00:16:02.741 --> 00:16:05.001
Fabulous hero

00:16:02.741 --> 00:16:05.001
A-class Hero, Rank 1.
Active model, actor, and singer.

00:16:03.331 --> 00:16:05.001
Thank you for having me.

00:16:05.661 --> 00:16:10.291
We are currently facing a Demon-level threat.

00:16:10.291 --> 00:16:11.881
What's your take on the situation?

00:16:13.051 --> 00:16:15.011
That is a difficult question.

00:16:15.011 --> 00:16:16.971
Why is that?

00:16:16.971 --> 00:16:20.601
I'm only a hero when I confront evil.

00:16:21.141 --> 00:16:24.601
The rest of the time,
I'm focused on my career as an artist.

00:16:24.601 --> 00:16:25.681
I see.

00:16:25.681 --> 00:16:29.611
I'm only here today to promote my new song.

00:16:29.611 --> 00:16:31.321
My apologies.

00:16:31.321 --> 00:16:34.111
In that case, let's discuss your song.

00:16:31.691 --> 00:16:38.791
Amai Mask

00:16:34.941 --> 00:16:38.781
Let me just say this.

00:16:39.201 --> 00:16:45.331
Heroes need to be both strong and determined
to assure the public of their safety

00:16:45.331 --> 00:16:52.291
and to defeat evil with speed, grace, and brilliance.

00:16:52.291 --> 00:16:53.631
I find it regrettable

00:16:53.631 --> 00:16:58.131
that in this instance, some heroes were overwhelmed by the forces of evil.

00:16:58.131 --> 00:17:04.261
I hope everyone will continue to train their hardest,
so that no hero ever dies in vain.

00:17:05.891 --> 00:17:07.851
My attacks have no effect.

00:17:07.851 --> 00:17:08.901
Are they too weak?

00:17:09.811 --> 00:17:11.401
I can't kill him unarmed.

00:17:11.731 --> 00:17:14.441
I must retreat for now and find a weapon.

00:17:15.821 --> 00:17:17.031
Caught you!

00:17:19.321 --> 00:17:21.661
Crack, crack. Snap, snap.

00:17:23.491 --> 00:17:24.491
Huh?

00:17:24.491 --> 00:17:26.291
Wait right there.

00:17:28.001 --> 00:17:30.831
Our next meeting will be your demise.

00:17:32.921 --> 00:17:34.591
No matter.

00:17:34.591 --> 00:17:37.011
The small fry can be let go.

00:17:42.261 --> 00:17:43.681
Who are you?

00:17:43.681 --> 00:17:44.761
What are you doing here?

00:17:45.761 --> 00:17:47.271
There were orders to evacuate.

00:17:48.231 --> 00:17:49.731
A hero?

00:17:49.731 --> 00:17:52.021
If you're after the Deep Sea King,
you'd better forget it.

00:17:52.351 --> 00:17:53.521
Deep Sea King?

00:17:53.521 --> 00:17:56.901
You heroes could all jump him at once and still lose.

00:17:57.281 --> 00:18:01.491
You're fine at playing make-believe,
but against true power you don't stand a chance.

00:18:01.491 --> 00:18:03.331
You can't protect a thing.

00:18:07.161 --> 00:18:09.201
Who was that pervert?

00:18:10.791 --> 00:18:11.791
The Seafolk?!

00:18:12.581 --> 00:18:14.751
I sense numerous life signals nearby.

00:18:15.341 --> 00:18:16.801
This many in one place…

00:18:17.631 --> 00:18:18.961
The evacuation shelter!

00:18:21.801 --> 00:18:25.221
Papa, are the scary monsters still outside?

00:18:25.551 --> 00:18:26.971
Don't worry.

00:18:26.971 --> 00:18:29.811
As long as we're in this shelter, we're safe.

00:18:29.811 --> 00:18:35.061
Besides, if it comes down to it, I'm sure
all of us together could beat a monster or two.

00:18:38.071 --> 00:18:39.531
I sense them.

00:18:39.531 --> 00:18:41.281
Yes, so many!

00:18:42.531 --> 00:18:46.281
They're all right over there!

00:18:53.001 --> 00:18:55.211
Greetings…

00:18:55.211 --> 00:18:57.051
and goodbye.

00:18:59.051 --> 00:19:00.841
P-Please wait!

00:19:01.761 --> 00:19:03.631
We surrender!

00:19:03.631 --> 00:19:06.101
We will comply with any demands you have.

00:19:06.601 --> 00:19:09.101
But please do not attack. I beg you.

00:19:10.141 --> 00:19:14.111
I evacuated because I'm only in Class C,
but now I'm trapped.

00:19:14.111 --> 00:19:17.401
I'm no hero. I'm a failure.

00:19:17.401 --> 00:19:18.691
Surrender?

00:19:20.571 --> 00:19:24.861
I've come to kill you.
Your deaths are inevitable!

00:19:24.861 --> 00:19:27.491
And as for my demands…

00:19:27.491 --> 00:19:31.621
How about I demand you
scream nicely as I slaughter you?

00:19:32.251 --> 00:19:33.751
It's over.

00:19:33.751 --> 00:19:34.921
I know it won't amount to much,

00:19:34.921 --> 00:19:38.711
but all I can do is buy time for the S-class heroes to get here.

00:19:38.711 --> 00:19:43.141
But look at this monster…

00:19:43.551 --> 00:19:44.551
Who am I kidding?

00:19:44.551 --> 00:19:46.801
I can't buy time just by talking to him.

00:19:48.641 --> 00:19:49.761
I pissed my pants…

00:19:50.561 --> 00:19:51.931
I'm pathetic.

00:19:53.731 --> 00:19:54.651
I'll fight with you!

00:19:54.941 --> 00:19:56.191
Heroes?

00:19:56.191 --> 00:19:57.651
There are others in here too?

00:19:58.481 --> 00:20:01.531
I may be ranked lowest at 38,

00:20:01.861 --> 00:20:04.031
but I'm still an A-class hero.

00:20:04.031 --> 00:20:05.281
We can do this.

00:20:05.701 --> 00:20:07.821
I-I'm a hero too!

00:20:07.821 --> 00:20:09.041
Allback Man is here!

00:20:09.581 --> 00:20:10.531
Heroes?

00:20:10.531 --> 00:20:12.161
The heroes are here?

00:20:12.161 --> 00:20:13.041
Heroes!

00:20:13.041 --> 00:20:14.291
They'll save us!

00:20:14.711 --> 00:20:17.581
I feel better with an A-class around.

00:20:17.581 --> 00:20:18.921
Yeah…

00:20:18.921 --> 00:20:22.631
Two from Class C, one from Class B,
and one from Class A…

00:20:23.341 --> 00:20:24.551
We can do it!

00:20:24.551 --> 00:20:25.381
We can win!

00:20:28.891 --> 00:20:30.681
You sure this is the way?

00:20:30.681 --> 00:20:31.681
Yes.

00:20:31.681 --> 00:20:35.651
Since residents are fleeing from this direction, we're sure to find monsters further up.

00:20:38.191 --> 00:20:40.561
Did you see a naked guy run past just now?

00:20:40.561 --> 00:20:41.611
What?

00:20:41.611 --> 00:20:43.361
Maybe he was taking a bath and got left behind.

00:20:44.191 --> 00:20:45.691
I'll check it out.

00:20:45.691 --> 00:20:47.281
Go on without me.

00:20:47.281 --> 00:20:48.161
Got it!

00:20:50.121 --> 00:20:51.331
Mumen Rider here.

00:20:51.741 --> 00:20:54.661
Yes, I'm on my way.

00:20:54.661 --> 00:20:56.411
What?! The shelter?

00:20:57.161 --> 00:20:59.091
It was the other way!

00:21:07.801 --> 00:21:11.091
All right. When I give the signal, charge him.

00:21:14.181 --> 00:21:15.691
One…

00:21:16.931 --> 00:21:17.981
Two…

00:21:18.601 --> 00:21:20.071
That's weird.

00:21:20.071 --> 00:21:22.271
I know I saw him…

00:21:34.371 --> 00:21:37.161
Why so quiet all of a sudden?

00:21:37.161 --> 00:21:39.501
Are you one of the Seafolk?

00:21:43.931 --> 00:21:50.691
Mumen Rider

00:21:44.421 --> 00:21:46.131
Mumen Rider went in?

00:21:46.131 --> 00:21:48.221
Yes. I couldn't stop—

00:21:48.221 --> 00:21:49.551
Mumen Rider?!

00:21:49.551 --> 00:21:50.681
What's your location?

00:21:51.131 --> 00:21:53.011
This is beyond you.

00:21:53.011 --> 00:21:55.181
The monster even took out an S-class hero!

00:21:55.721 --> 00:21:58.681
We need to assemble a subjugation squad.

00:21:58.681 --> 00:22:00.981
An S-class hero was defeated?

00:22:00.981 --> 00:22:01.821
Who is this?

00:22:02.311 --> 00:22:03.981
Where's Mumen Rider?

00:22:06.271 --> 00:22:07.611
Stand-up Pedaling Mode!

00:22:08.361 --> 00:22:11.121
Roar, Justice!

00:22:11.411 --> 00:22:13.781
Is this the Hero Association?

00:22:13.781 --> 00:22:16.121
Yes. Who are you?

00:22:16.121 --> 00:22:19.251
Get me the owner of that cell phone right now!

00:22:19.251 --> 00:22:21.291
This is the hero Saitama.

00:22:21.871 --> 00:22:22.501
Saitama?

00:22:31.601 --> 00:22:37.851
Hey, come back home soon

00:22:31.601 --> 00:22:37.851
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:22:45.151 --> 00:22:51.071
When my worries keep me awake under the crescent moon

00:22:45.151 --> 00:22:51.071
tameiki ga mikazuki wo yurasu yoru wa

00:22:51.071 --> 00:22:57.201
All I can do is close my eyes and think of you

00:22:51.071 --> 00:22:57.201
me wo tojite kimi no koto kangaete bakari

00:22:57.201 --> 00:23:00.251
I want to see you, I feel like crying

00:22:57.201 --> 00:23:00.251
aitai kibun nakitai kibun

00:23:00.251 --> 00:23:02.751
I feel so romantic

00:23:00.251 --> 00:23:02.751
romantikku na kibun

00:23:02.751 --> 00:23:09.301
I hope my feelings reach you

00:23:02.751 --> 00:23:09.301
todokete kono omoi

00:23:09.761 --> 00:23:18.061
I know so very well

00:23:09.761 --> 00:23:18.061
datte zutto shitteiru no

00:23:18.061 --> 00:23:23.271
how hard you always work

00:23:18.061 --> 00:23:23.271
ganbatteru koto takusan

00:23:24.981 --> 00:23:27.941
You're the one I love

00:23:24.981 --> 00:23:27.941
daisuki na hito ga

00:23:27.941 --> 00:23:31.071
You're so strong, yet still I worry

00:23:27.941 --> 00:23:31.071
tsuyokute shinpai

00:23:31.071 --> 00:23:37.041
Only I ever see your weakness

00:23:31.071 --> 00:23:37.041
watashi ni dake wa yowasa misete

00:23:37.041 --> 00:23:43.081
I'll find you before the stars

00:23:37.041 --> 00:23:43.081
hoshi yori saki ni mitsukete ageru

00:23:43.081 --> 00:23:48.921
Come right back home

00:23:43.081 --> 00:23:48.921
massugu kaette kite ne

00:23:48.921 --> 00:23:57.141
Hey, come back home soon

00:23:48.921 --> 00:23:57.141
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:23:59.981 --> 00:24:20.001
NEXT
TIME

00:23:59.981 --> 00:24:20.001
UNYIELDING
JUSTICE

00:24:00.761 --> 00:24:03.561
Hey, how'd you like my Gigantic Drill Stinger?

00:24:03.561 --> 00:24:06.481
By the way, I nailed ten of those Seafolk things!

00:24:06.481 --> 00:24:07.601
You're pretty upbeat.

00:24:07.601 --> 00:24:08.941
Oh, Lightning Max?

00:24:08.941 --> 00:24:12.481
I won't ask how many Seafolk you defeated,
but I'm sure you did great.

00:24:12.481 --> 00:24:14.361
Next time, on One Punch Man : Episode 9,

00:24:14.361 --> 00:24:15.571
"Unyielding Justice."

00:24:15.571 --> 00:24:19.991
I'm not sure who'll be dishing it out,
but make sure our sacrifices weren't in vain!
